  answering every name with 10.9.9.9 (ttl 30):

    eth3 DNS frames (our queries + the answers returned) : 10
    eth4 DNS frames (forwarded upstream + upstream replies): 10
    upstream queries the DUT FORWARDED (tcpdump)         : 5
    upstream queries the responder RECEIVED              : 5, answered 5
    QUERIES SENT: 5   ANSWERS RECEIVED: 5
      ck1.test -> 10.9.9.9 (ttl 30)   ck2.test -> 10.9.9.9   ck3.test -> 10.9.9.9
      ck4.test -> 10.9.9.9            ck5.test -> 10.9.9.9

