  The scapy DHCP server offers option 6 = 192.168.48.2. After the lease:

awplus# show ip name-server
  Currently learned name-servers:
  192.168.48.2 dynamic (vlan48)
  192.168.48.9 static
                                             <-- the DHCP-learned server appears, tagged
                                                 `dynamic` AND with the interface that
